cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Galileo in your teaching, research or writing, please cite it as below."
title: "Galileo: a computer algebra system in Rust"
abstract: "Galileo is a small computer algebra system with exact arithmetic, symbolic algebra and calculus, matrices, number theory, plotting and differential geometry. It runs as a command-line REPL, a Jupyter kernel, and in the browser through WebAssembly."
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Esch
    given-names: Joris
    alias: cascala
version: "0.5.0"
license: Apache-2.0
url: "https://cascala.github.io/igalileo/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/cascala/galileo"
keywords:
  - computer algebra
  - symbolic mathematics
  - mathematics education
  - Jupyter
  - WebAssembly
